@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFF
title 借阅状态管理核心流程
left to right direction

state "初始请求" as start
state "状态校验" as validation
state "违规处理" as violation
state "正常处理" as normal
state "更新状态" as update
state "结束" as end

start -> validation : 输入(id, status)

validation --> violation : 是违规状态?\n(EXPIRED/OVERDUE/LOST)
validation --> normal : 是正常状态?\n(CANCELLED/BORROWED/RETURNED)

violation -> update : 执行信用分扣减\n生成违规记录
normal -> update : 执行库存/时间操作

update -> end : 返回操作结果

' 状态转换示意
note bottom of validation
  关键校验规则：
  1. 禁止设为APPLIED
  2. EXPIRED←APPLIED
  3. OVERDUE←BORROWED
  4. LOST←BORROWED/OVERDUE
  5. RETURNED←BORROWED/OVERDUE
end note
@enduml